<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:55:39 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>美联储理事承认人们现在认为通胀上升是新常态：“这就是我们需要开始打破的心理”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/fed-rate-hikes-higher-inflation-expectations-unanchored-chris-waller/</link><description>“所以你可能需要让人们震惊地说，‘等一下，3% 不是你应该考虑的未来数字。’” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2240975939-e1795183154518.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:08:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/fed-rate-hikes-higher-inflation-expectations-unanchored-chris-waller/</guid></item><item><title>以下是 Anthropic 810 亿美元 IPO 中最富有的人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/heres-whos-getting-the-richest-from-anthropics-81-billion-ipo-tech-stocks-ai-dario-amodei-daniela-amodei/</link><description>Anthropic 历史性的 IPO 为其七位联合创始人、早期员工以及包括亚马逊和谷歌在内的投资者创造了巨额财富。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305321358_9bad7f-e1795206387526.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:42:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/heres-whos-getting-the-richest-from-anthropics-81-billion-ipo-tech-stocks-ai-dario-amodei-daniela-amodei/</guid></item><item><title>一只手放在控制器上，一只手放在披萨卷上：美国如何在 GTA VI 耗资 37.9 亿美元的发布之夜养活自己</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/gta-grand-theft-auto-6-vi-food-delivery-services-orders/</link><description>《GTA VI》在两天内吸引的观看时间比任何游戏完整发布周的观看时间还要多。外卖应用程序围绕可以用一只手吃的食物进行交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2303488896-e1795200365442.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:16:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/gta-grand-theft-auto-6-vi-food-delivery-services-orders/</guid></item><item><title>随着民主党加大对新兴行业的热情，参议院通过了有史以来第一个预测市场法案</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/senate-passes-first-ever-prediction-market-bill-as-democrats-turn-up-heat-on-upstart-industry/</link><description>《死亡投注法》将禁止与战争和死亡相关的投注，而单独的提案则针对体育运动。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2288244515-e1795193510255.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:53:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/senate-passes-first-ever-prediction-market-bill-as-democrats-turn-up-heat-on-upstart-industry/</guid></item><item><title>法国巴黎银行认为人工智能抛售将导致标准普尔 500 指数进入回调并抹去纳斯达克指数 2026 年的涨幅，从而引发“恐慌性抛售”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/sp-500-correction-panic-selling-ai-selloff-nasdaq-2026-gains-bnp-paribas/</link><description>随着人工智能抛售蔓延，标准普尔 500 指数和道琼斯指数周五下跌超过历史记录 10% 以上。华尔街的一些人称之为恐慌。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26302486751135-web.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:38:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/sp-500-correction-panic-selling-ai-selloff-nasdaq-2026-gains-bnp-paribas/</guid></item><item><title>肯·格里芬 (Ken Griffin) 刚刚完成 CMU 创纪录的 30 亿美元承诺，向匹兹堡捐赠了 3 只恐龙和 500 万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/ken-griffin-dinosaur-fossils-carnegie-museum-pittsburgh/</link><description>Citadel 首席执行官提供了 3 只怀俄明州蜥脚类恐龙为期 10 年的贷款，其中包括 500 万美元用于建设公共化石实验室，游客可以在那里观看科学家的工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2300673056.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:16:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/ken-griffin-dinosaur-fossils-carnegie-museum-pittsburgh/</guid></item><item><title>有人算了一下民主党前100天的议程：伊朗战争节省了300亿美元，但国债增加了4.1万亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/democrat-first-100-day-midterm-policy-posts-national-debt/</link><description>负责任的联邦预算委员会指出，缓和中东战争将节省 300 亿美元，而结束特朗普关税将削减原本创造 2,870 亿美元的收入来源。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305196340.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:11:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/democrat-first-100-day-midterm-policy-posts-national-debt/</guid></item><item><title>Arist 首席执行官 Michael Ioffe 预测，人工智能可能很快就会建议裁员：“决策速度要快得多”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/16/arist-ceo-michael-ioffe-ai-agents-layoffs/</link><description>Arist 的首席执行官表示，人工智能代理可能很快就会推荐重大公司决策，包括裁员，但高管仍将做出最终决定。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/55656693831_50f4a64662_o-e1794858796727.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:04:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/16/arist-ceo-michael-ioffe-ai-agents-layoffs/</guid></item><item><title>随着注意力从伊朗和石油转移，世界发生了永远的变化，冲突再次升级</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/attention-spans-move-iran-world-forever-changed-conflict-escalating/</link><description>尽管全球能源需求持续飙升，但全球石油需求预计将在 2030 年达到峰值。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305023871-e1795131426539.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/attention-spans-move-iran-world-forever-changed-conflict-escalating/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 股价下跌至仅比 IPO 价格高出 5 美分，与首日涨幅惊人逆转</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/anthropic-stock-teeters-close-to-ipo-price-in-second-day-of-trading/</link><description>在放弃了首日的大部分涨幅后，AI 实验室的股价周五跌至 83.15 美元，仅比 83 美元的 IPO 价格高出几美分。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305413796-e1795195810143.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:44:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/anthropic-stock-teeters-close-to-ipo-price-in-second-day-of-trading/</guid></item></channel></rss>